<h1>Registration submitted for <%= @new_registration.collection.title %></h1>
<p>
    Dear <%= @new_registration.user.name %>,
</p>
<p>
    Thank you for registering for
    <strong><%= @new_registration.collection.title %></strong>.
    Your registration status as of this
    message is "<%= @new_registration.status %>".
</p>
<p>
    To access your registration and view its up-to-date status, please visit the following link on ScholarLattice:
    <%= link_to "Manage Registration", new_registration_url(@new_registration) %> or copy-paste
    the URL below into your browser:
</p>
<p>
    <code><%= new_registration_url(@new_registration) %></code>
</p>
<p>
    For your security, you may be required to enter and verify your email
    <code><%= @new_registration.user.email %></code>
    before you can access this registration.
</p>
